== "Thiva is a singer-musician star." ==
Thiva is a character released with 4th-anniversary Update in a collaboration with Like Mike.

== About ==
Thiva is the little brother of Dimitri.

He was innately talented and played music throughout his childhood.

He really wants to help the world and improve people's lives but believes the best way to do that is to reach the individual with a true message through his music.

== Ability ==

=== Passive (Vital vibes) ===
The speed of helping up teammates is increased by 70%.Cooldown 90s. The helped up teammate recovers 60 Hp in 3S.

== play style ==
You can't revive your teammates in time before the enemy charges you, but Thiva can, Thiva can help teammates In a situation where it is too difficult to revive, in 4 second when you don't have thiva skill you need to revive time 3s and get hp just 20 hp but in 4 second as same Thiva can revive in 1s and can get hp to 80 hp According to the skill description, If you're someone who likes to revive teammates frequently or need to save a tough situation, he's the one for you.

